WEBVTT

NOTE
Bahamut - Mega Flare. Dragon king summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~40 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Bahamut. Mega Flare.

00:02.500 --> 00:09.000
Dark misty clouds gather. A vast purple-and-blue dragon glides into view.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.000
Bahamut hovers above, spreads massive leathery wings, and arches his neck back.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Energy gathers in his open jaws; a brilliant white-blue ball of light grows.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Bahamut releases Mega Flare — a colossal beam of pure energy washes over the enemies.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
The beam fades; only smoke and shockwaves remain on the field.

00:38.000 --> 00:41.000
Bahamut wheels away into the dark.
